  "description": "OpenTAP is a fast simple and extensible test sequencing engine. It controls test plan (list of test steps) execution and provides access to functionality offered by the plugins. This covers logging functionality, result handling (database) and instrument communication (user-developed hardware drivers, for example). OpenTAP also includes a CLI and a plugin manager that finds and handles plugins (test steps, DUT and Instrument interfaces, etc.).",
